WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.250
Ryu advances toward Ken with Drive Rush.

2
00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:02.000
Ryu strikes Ken with the forward-medium overhead.

3
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.600
Ryu converts the close follow-up into Shoryuken.

4
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:04.200
Ken is down after the overhead conversion.
